      "text": "A polished hand-painted 2D storybook animation of the SAME approved mermaid Roshan, shown as one complete moving figure. Clean, crisp navy painted outlines and distinct fingers in EVERY pose. Short-exposure, sharply defined animation frames; gentle measured movement. The whole figure acts together, with continuous anatomy and the same face, costume, pink bodice, purple mermaid tail, hair and painted materials.\n0.0\u20130.4s: Roshan begins at rest and raises her image-left hand to shoulder height. That shoulder lifts and turns slightly; the upper torso follows with a small natural lean, her painted dress/bodice shifts with her chest, and her hair responds softly.\n0.4\u20130.9s: The hand rises above her head into a friendly open-palm greeting. Her shoulder, ribcage and bodice move together in a coordinated small stretch; her opposite shoulder counterbalances. Her tail responds subtly below the waist. Keep the hand and fingers sharp and readable throughout the rise.\n0.9\u20131.3s: She lowers the greeting hand. Shoulder and torso relax together, with a small follow-through in the hair and bodice. Keep continuous joint attachment and crisp contours, including the moving hand.\n1.3\u20131.7s: The whole figure settles gently into the original complete rest pose. Her pelvis/root stays near its initial location; it is an anchor for registration, not a frozen body. No walking or camera movement.\nFixed full-figure view on uniform pale gray. Preserve character proportions and her mermaid tail; no legs, extra limbs or new costume details. No motion blur, exposure smearing, ghost limbs, trails, painterly streaks, dissolving fingers or temporal crossfades. Every frame is a sharp painted pose with one coherent complete figure. Sound: silence.\n"
